        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Haile Selassie</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1892 CE – 1975 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">23 July 1892, in the village of Ejersa Goro, Hararghe province, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ethiopia">Ethiopia</a>; son of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ras">Ras</a> Makonnen Wolde Mikael, of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/solomonic-dynasty">Solomonic dynasty</a></span></div>
